# KIMI Diary Template (AAAK Format)

## Format
```
SESSION:YYYYMMDD|TYPE:task_type|FILES:count|STATUS:GO/NO-GO|★rating
```

## Type Codes
- FEAT = Feature implementation
- FIX = Bug fix
- REF = Refactoring
- DOC = Documentation
- OPT = Optimization
- SEC = Security fix

## Eksempel
```
SESSION:20260409|TYPE:FEAT|FILES:5|STATUS:GO|★★★
TASK:optimize-mempalace|AGENT:kimi|SCOPE:analysis
DEC:activate-raw-mode|ALT:[fix-chroma,disable-search]|★★★★
```

## Usage
```bash
# Skriv til diary
mempalace_diary_write --agent_name=kimi --entry="SESSION:..."

# Les siste entries
mempalace_diary_read --agent_name=kimi --last_n=5
```
